                <row><cell>On-Level Learners (Core)</cell><cell>Full activity and all examples. Assign <xref ref="ex-translate-two-points"/> to <xref ref="ex-lane-arrows"/>.</cell></row>
                <row><cell>Advanced Learners (Challenge)</cell><cell>All exercises including <xref ref="ex-two-translations"/>. Extension: a translation maps <m>(3, -1)</m> to <m>(-2, 4)</m>. Where does it map the origin? (Answer: <m>(-5, 5)</m>.)</cell></row>
            </tabular>
        </table>
    </axiom>

